Limit: a CEO peer mention whose claim is still open after the CTO's generation moved is not reachable through the daemon's own composition, because a takeover rejects a queued peer row and settles its claim in the same transaction; its regression reopens the claim directly
Limit: the floor is asked of a spent event id only when the guard answers INGRESS_REPLAY_IGNORED or INGRESS_TURN_OUTCOME_UNKNOWN and the addressed role has an active target; a replay with no signed time, as the local socket's, still commits its replay audit row
