Warn: a redelivery of an event admitted under an earlier binding generation is now counted under admission-precedes-binding rather than admission-already-durable
Warn: the floor's refusal of a spent event id is thrown and rolls the guard's audit row back, so a code added to SPENT_NONCE_CODES must be one IngressGuard.admit returns only past its allowlist and signature
